(text "D1 SMBJ12CA REMOVED: unsafe at sustained 15/20 V. eFuse OVP cuts output, NOT input.\nDefault OFF. Dedicated 5 V or PD 9 V source only. No host-current negotiation.\nTentative simultaneous loads: 5 V input: 20 mA EACH rail; PD 9 V: 40 mA EACH rail.\nNo output ratings are warranted. User target currents, transient loads and noise limits remain unspecified.\nPCB files: USB connector + mechanical holes ONLY. Absolutely NO tracks, vias or zones.\nRead ../README.md before using or updating a PCB from schematic." (at 20 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "dfbbfd34-f9ed-55b0-8384-e36256067e27"))
